=======================================================================
Third-party components distributed with gslint
=======================================================================

gslint itself declares only one runtime dependency, gosu-core. The
components listed below are pulled in transitively through gosu-core-api.
How they reach you depends on which artifact you use:

  - The runnable ("uber") JAR - gslint-<version>-gosu-<gosu-version>.jar -
    is assembled with the Maven Shade plugin, which copies these
    components' compiled classes directly into that single JAR. They are
    physically present in the artifact you receive.

  - When gslint is used as a library (the thin gslint-<version>.jar), these
    components are not inside that JAR; they are resolved by your build onto
    your classpath as separate JARs, and you redistribute them.

Either way these components remain governed by the licenses reproduced
below, so their copyright and license notices are included here.

Two of them are Guidewire's own repackaged "managed" builds of well-known
libraries: ASM and JCommander are published under the
org.gosu-lang.gosu.managed group as gw-asm-all and gw-jcommander, with
their packages relocated under gw.internal.ext. Despite the renamed
artifacts and relocated packages, they remain the ASM and JCommander
projects and are licensed under the original ASM and JCommander terms
shown below.

The Manifold libraries (the systems.manifold group: manifold, manifold-rt,
manifold-util) are a separate third-party project that gosu-core-api depends
on directly; they too arrive only because gslint depends on gosu-core, not
because gslint uses Manifold itself.

Components (transitive through gosu-core):

  org.gosu-lang.gosu:gosu-core             Apache-2.0
  org.gosu-lang.gosu:gosu-core-api         Apache-2.0
  org.gosu-lang.gosu.managed:gw-asm-all    ASM,        BSD-3-Clause
  org.gosu-lang.gosu.managed:gw-jcommander JCommander, Apache-2.0
  systems.manifold:manifold                Apache-2.0
  systems.manifold:manifold-rt             Apache-2.0
  systems.manifold:manifold-util           Apache-2.0


